  ],
  "sources": [
    "E. J. Bergholtz, J. C. Budich, F. K. Kunst, “Exceptional topology of non‑Hermitian systems”, Rev. Mod. Phys. 93, 015005 (2021). (review discussing EPs in Bloch Hamiltonians and parameter space)",
