  ],
  "sources": [
    "Özel, F. & Freire, P. (2016). Masses, radii, and the equation of state of neutron stars. Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics. DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-081915-023322 (review stating that the EOS uniquely determines the M–R relation via the TOV equations).",
    "Tolman, R. C. (1939). Static Solutions of Einstein's Field Equations for Spheres of Fluid; Oppenheimer, J. R. & Volkoff, G. M. (1939). On Massive Neutron Cores. Physical Review (original derivation of the TOV equations showing how an EOS produces the stellar mass–radius relation)."
  ]
